      "title": "New delete endpoints have no tests",
      "description": "The change adds two user deletion endpoints, and the repository has no test that exercises them. Tests would cover the admin check and the unknown id path. Regressions in the authorization or error handling of user deletion can ship unnoticed. Add tests that call both endpoints as admin, as non-admin, and with an unknown id.",
